# SQLite file of this service: it belongs to the machine, not to the repository
data/

# TypeScript incremental cache: a build artifact, regenerated on every machine.
# 🪦 It was tracked in the source tree (ai-workspace/services/auth/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo)
# and was deliberately NOT carried over at the move of 2026-09-20 — a stale cache
# from another machine is the one thing here that can make a type check lie.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

